      <data key="d1">"Xiao Hong is the individual who defined the concept of a 'twin array' and is involved in the problem of transforming an array into such a structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 defined and is the subject of the '小红的好数组' event, which involves analyzing arrays for specific properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了好数组的概念，并提出了相关的问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who defined the '好数组' problem and is involved in the programming task."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是提出构造3阶行列式问题的人，要求每个元素绝对值不小于1且行列式值等于x。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是希望构造满足特定条件的3阶行列式的学生。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the student who is trying to construct a permutation that meets specific constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who defines the concept of a dual array and the problem of transforming an array into such a structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who defines and solves a problem related to transforming a 01 matrix into a specific 'good matrix' structure through a series of operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who is tasked with transforming a 01 matrix into a good matrix by performing specific operations on the matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了一个好矩阵，并尝试通过交换相邻字符将其转换为满足条件的矩阵。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是定义好矩阵条件并尝试将其转换为好矩阵的人。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who needs to determine the minimum cost for the bitwise operation problem."</data>
